      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d9e340de0d58e432159d1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安啊～☆★☆在迎接\r\n新太阳公公的同时互相问候！\r\n今天也是很棒的一天呢★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a3245539dadbf65db3440c32650f09b5b34133500b9f2048ed2140ed29a63f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf767b0b48898b86db25246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说听我说！今天散步的时候啊，\r\n我拍到了非常漂亮的照片呢！\r\n朝霞就像是熏衣草田一样☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "c959fe542b7ed97e81a361e71780eef8f6bd08b4adb676d678623a68ac4d5068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450016aaf8b52ae7a0445fb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……☆哎呀？\r\n眼皮快要阖上了……不过……\r\n梦里的世界……也很美……丽……★",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a0a709b07b7579ee8ea2cff23f332d3efe26637cb392f05ca6d9d3d57fa68b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde808809ac6806396aee2d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饭吃饭～！掷骰子决定菜色☆\r\n紧张刺激听天由命★☆★\r\n经典料理、珍馐佳肴……会中哪个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "321353ce69f5ade2b7bf8188293dbb32955da1e23ef63fecccf915f0306fcbbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27c0a1a66fd8d27d32e00ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忙到这么晚辛苦了☆★☆\r\n你付出许多努力的轨迹\r\n造就了这个世界！谢谢你★",
      "source_fingerprint": "493e22a1814abc31ebf92ab1b57aed1359f09834d85bcbe9845985703212f148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0845768708a0ead9c35a8c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一天也撑过去了～☆★\r\n完成工作是件很厉害的事！\r\n夸奖自己「好棒棒」吧～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af17afaee2f5f59900070fba1579eaa666b27a2e6ff40b1ab7284f7444485ba",
